# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Terminals and equipment made components (bim_ifc_native.dl): two air
# terminals of one mapped shape, the second turned a quarter, become two
# instances of one component whose mesh is the file's triangles and whose
# duct port is its connector; the duct standing on the first one's port
# joins it in the network. Two light fixtures without ports share a
# component too; a third of the same shape under another type name has
# its own. A proxy with a pipe port is equipment; a proxy without a
# port stays an imported element. A component of meshes alone is shown by
# its triangles as they stand, without the kernel's fold.
import ifc/bim_ifc_native.dl
import mep/common/bim_network.dl
import elements/object/bim_component.dl
import ui/editor/bim_editor.dl

